@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### список оценок: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades

### добавить оценку: 201
# @name createGrade
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": "Ivan Petrov",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "value": 5,
  "date": "2026-09-09",
  "comment": "Homework"
}

### получить оценку: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/{{createGrade.response.body.$.id}}

### фильтр 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades?student=Ivan%20Petrov&subject=Mathematics

### замена оценки 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grades/{{createGrade.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": "Ivan Petrov",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "value": 4,
  "date": "2026-09-09",
  "comment": "Corrected grade"
}

### неправильное значение 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": "Ivan Petrov",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "value": 6,
  "date": "2026-09-09"
}

### 204, empty body
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grades/{{createGrade.response.body.$.id}}

### 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grades/{{createGrade.response.body.$.id}}
